[Marty] Tom.

1811
02:01:36.166 --> 02:01:39.208
It's me. Just put the gun down.

1812
02:01:40.791 --> 02:01:43.000
Sir, don't do it.

1813
02:01:43.083 --> 02:01:45.000
Tom, put it down.

1814
02:01:46.583 --> 02:01:47.583
No.

1815
